OL,3,AUK cannot 'cherry pick' EU single
OL,4,Amarket deal, Barnier tells BBC
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe EU's former Brexit negotiator has
OL,7,Fwarned Andy Burnham he will not be able
OL,8,Fto rejoin its single market "C  la
OL,9,Fcarte", after the prime minister said
OL,10,Fhe wanted to explore closer economic
OL,11,Fties with Europe.
OL,13,FBurnham has said rejoining the EU's
OL,14,Finternal market is among options he
OL,15,Fcould pursue to reshape the UK's
OL,16,Flong-term relationship with the bloc.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
