OL,3,AUK cannot 'cherry pick' EU single
OL,4,Amarket deal, Barnier tells BBC
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking to the BBC's Sunday With Laura
OL,7,FKuenssberg ahead of a summit in 10
OL,8,Fdays' time, Michel Barnier said EU
OL,9,Fmembers would insist such a move
OL,10,Frequire the UK to readopt conditions
OL,11,Fincluding the free movement of people.
OL,13,FEchoing a line made famous during the
OL,14,Fyears-long negotiations over the UK's
OL,15,Fexit deal, he said there could be no
OL,16,F"cherry picking" of the conditions for
OL,17,Fparticipation.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
